  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The irregular",
   "texto": [
    "**する** → **できる** (can do). **くる** → **こられる** (be able to come).",
    "What can be done is the **が**: **にほんご が はなせます** particle. Remember it's **が**, not **を**."
